Face models used by Photographic Studio By Bill (Portrait section)

face_detection_short_range.tflite   BlazeFace, short range
face_detection_full_range.tflite    BlazeFace, full range
face_landmark.tflite                Face Mesh (468 points)
iris_landmark.tflite                MediaPipe Iris (iris centre and edge, eyelids), added 2026-11-15
face_landmarker_v2.tflite           Face Landmarker v2 / FaceMesh-V2 (478 points, irises included), added 2026-11-15

